    "generator_key_rsa_note" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alle SSH-kliënte ondersteun hierdie algoritme. 'n Sleutelgrootte van ten minste 2048 bisse word aanbeveel vir RSA; 4096 bisse is beter. Dit is heeltemal moontlik dat die RSA-algoritme in die voorsienbare toekoms prakties breekbaar sal word."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تدعم جميع عملاء SSH هذه الخوارزمية. يوصى بحجم مفتاح لا يقل عن 2048 بت لـ RSA؛ 4096 بت أفضل. من المحتمل جدًا أن تصبح خوارزمية RSA قابلة للكسر عمليًا في المستقبل المنظور."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All SSH clients support this algorithm. A key size of at least 2048 bits is recommended for RSA; 4096 bits is better. It is quite possible the RSA algorithm will become practically breakable in the foreseeable future."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tots els clients SSH suporten aquest algoritme. Una mida de clau d'almenys 2048 bits està recomanat per a RSA; 4096 bits és millor. És bastant probable que l'algoritme RSA sigui violable en un futur no molt llunyà."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Všichni SSH klienti podporují tento algoritmus. Pro RSA se doporučuje velikost klíče alespoň 2048 bitů; 4096 bitů je lepší. Je docela možné, že se algoritmus RSA stane prakticky prolomitelným."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alle SSH-klienter understøtter denne algoritme. En nøglestørrelse på mindst 2048 bits anbefales til RSA; 4096 bits er bedre. Det er meget muligt, at RSA-algoritmen vil kunne knækkes i praksis indenfor en overskuelig fremtid."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alle SSH-Clients unterstützen diesen Algorithmus. Eine Schlüsselgröße von mindestens 2048 Bit wird für RSA empfohlen; 4096 Bit ist besser. Es ist durchaus möglich, dass der RSA-Algorithmus in absehbarer Zeit entschlüsselt werden kann."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All SSH clients support this algorithm. A key size of at least 2048 bits is recommended for RSA; 4096 bits is better. It is quite possible the RSA algorithm will become practically breakable in the foreseeable future."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All SSH clients support this algorithm. A key size of at least 2048 bits is recommended for RSA; 4096 bits is better. It is quite possible the RSA algorithm will become practically breakable in the foreseeable future."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All SSH clients support this algorithm. A key size of at least 2048 bits is recommended for RSA; 4096 bits is better. It is quite possible the RSA algorithm will become practically breakable in the foreseeable future."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All SSH clients support this algorithm. A key size of at least 2048 bits is recommended for RSA; 4096 bits is better. It is quite possible the RSA algorithm will become practically breakable in the foreseeable future."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todos los clientes SSH soportan este algoritmo. Se recomienda un tamaño de clave de al menos 2048 bits para RSA; 4096 bits es mejor. Es bastante posible que el algoritmo RSA se vuelva rompible de forma práctica en un futuro predecible."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All SSH clients support this algorithm. A key size of at least 2048 bits is recommended for RSA; 4096 bits is better. It is quite possible the RSA algorithm will become practically breakable in the foreseeable future."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tous les clients SSH prennent en charge cet algorithme. Une taille de clé d'au moins 2048 bits est recommandée pour le protocole RSA mais 4096 bits est mieux. Il est tout à fait possible que l'algorithme RSA devienne pratiquement cassable dans un avenir proche."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All SSH clients support this algorithm. A key size of at least 2048 bits is recommended for RSA; 4096 bits is better. It is quite possible the RSA algorithm will become practically breakable in the foreseeable future."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Minden SSH kliens támogatja ezt az algoritmust. Legalább 2048 bites kulcsméret ajánlott RSA esetén; a 4096 bit jobb. Teljesen lehetséges, hogy az RSA algoritmus a belátható jövőben gyakorlatilag feltörhetővé válik."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tutti i client SSH supportano questo algoritmo. Per RSA si consiglia una dimensione della chiave di almeno 2048 bit, ma l'ideale sarebbe averne 4096. È assai possibile che l'algoritmo RSA diventi in pratica violabile nel prossimo futuro."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "すべての SSH クライアントはこのアルゴリズムをサポートしています。RSA には少なくとも 2048 ビットの鍵のサイズが推奨され、4096 ビットがより優れています。RSA アルゴリズムは近い将来、実際に破られる可能性は十分に考えられます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "모든 SSH 클라이언트에서 지원하는 알고리즘입니다. RSA 키 크기 추천 값은 최소 2048 비트, 권장 4096 비트입니다. 머지않은 미래에 RSA 알고리즘이 깨질 가능성이 매우 높습니다."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All SSH clients support this algorithm. A key size of at least 2048 bits is recommended for RSA; 4096 bits is better. It is quite possible the RSA algorithm will become practically breakable in the foreseeable future."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alle SSH clients ondersteunen dit algoritme. Een sleutelgrootte van ten minste 2048 bits is aanbevolen voor RSA; 4096 bits is sterker, maar vereist meer rekenkracht."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All SSH clients support this algorithm. A key size of at least 2048 bits is recommended for RSA; 4096 bits is better. It is quite possible the RSA algorithm will become practically breakable in the foreseeable future."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todos os clientes SSH suportam este algoritmo. Um tamanho de chave de pelo menos 2048 bits é recomendado para RSA; 4096 bits é melhor. É perfeitamente possível que o algoritmo RSA se torne praticamente quebrável num futuro previsível."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todos os clientes SSH suportam este algoritmo. Um tamanho de chave de pelo menos 2048 bits é recomendado para RSA; 4096 bits é melhor. É perfeitamente possível que o algoritmo RSA se torne praticamente quebrável num futuro previsível."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All SSH clients support this algorithm. A key size of at least 2048 bits is recommended for RSA; 4096 bits is better. It is quite possible the RSA algorithm will become practically breakable in the foreseeable future."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Все клиенты SSH поддерживают этот алгоритм. Для RSA рекомендуется размер ключа не менее 2048 бит, лучше - 4096 бит. Вполне возможно, что в обозримом будущем алгоритм RSA станет уязвимым."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All SSH clients support this algorithm. A key size of at least 2048 bits is recommended for RSA; 4096 bits is better. It is quite possible the RSA algorithm will become practically breakable in the foreseeable future."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All SSH clients support this algorithm. A key size of at least 2048 bits is recommended for RSA; 4096 bits is better. It is quite possible the RSA algorithm will become practically breakable in the foreseeable future."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tüm SSH istemcileri bu algoritmayı destekler. RSA için en az 2048 bit anahtar boyutu önerilir; 4096 bit daha iyidir. Öngörülebilir gelecekte RSA algoritmasının pratik olarak kırılabilir hale gelmesi oldukça olasıdır."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Підтримується всіма SSH клієнтами. Рекомендується використовувати 4096-бітний або 2048-бітний ключ. Алгоритм RSA може перестати бути безпечним в недалекому майбутньому."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tất cả các máy khách SSH đều hỗ trợ thuật toán này. Kích thước khóa ít nhất là 2048 bit được khuyến nghị cho RSA; 4096 bit là tốt hơn. Thuật toán RSA hoàn toàn có khả năng bị phá vỡ trong tương lai gần."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有 SSH 客户端都支持这种算法。对于 RSA，推荐至少使用 2048 位的密钥大小；4096 位则更好。在可预见的未来，RSA算法变得实际上可以破解是相当可能的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有 SSH 客戶端都支援這種演算法。對於 RSA，推薦至少使用 2048 位的金鑰大小；4096 位則更好。在可預見的未來，RSA演算法變得實際上可以破解是相當可能的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
