            "value" : "Run GnuPG commands from a shell that points to Keyguard's agent home. Keyguard listens on the agent socket that GnuPG resolves for this home."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Führen Sie GnuPG-Befehle in einer Shell aus, die auf das Agenten-Home-Verzeichnis von Keyguard verweist. Keyguard lauscht am Agenten-Socket, den GnuPG für dieses Home-Verzeichnis auflöst."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Run GnuPG commands from a shell that points to Keyguard's agent home. Keyguard listens on the agent socket that GnuPG resolves for this home."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Run GnuPG commands from a shell that points to Keyguard's agent home. Keyguard listens on the agent socket that GnuPG resolves for this home."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Run GnuPG commands from a shell that points to Keyguard's agent home. Keyguard listens on the agent socket that GnuPG resolves for this home."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Run GnuPG commands from a shell that points to Keyguard's agent home. Keyguard listens on the agent socket that GnuPG resolves for this home."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ejecute comandos de GnuPG desde una shell que apunte al directorio del agente de Keyguard. Keyguard escucha en el socket del agente que GnuPG resuelve para este directorio."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Run GnuPG commands from a shell that points to Keyguard's agent home. Keyguard listens on the agent socket that GnuPG resolves for this home."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exécutez les commandes GnuPG depuis un shell qui pointe vers le répertoire d'agent de Keyguard. Keyguard écoute sur le socket d'agent que GnuPG résout pour ce répertoire."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Run GnuPG commands from a shell that points to Keyguard's agent home. Keyguard listens on the agent socket that GnuPG resolves for this home."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Run GnuPG commands from a shell that points to Keyguard's agent home. Keyguard listens on the agent socket that GnuPG resolves for this home."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esegui i comandi GnuPG da una shell che punta alla home dell'agente di Keyguard. Keyguard è in ascolto sul socket dell'agente che GnuPG risolve per questa home."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keyguard のエージェントホームを指すシェルから GnuPG コマンドを実行します。Keyguard は、このホームに対して GnuPG が解決するエージェントソケットで待ち受けます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keyguard의 에이전트 홈을 가리키는 셸에서 GnuPG 명령어를 실행하세요. Keyguard는 GnuPG가 이 홈에 대해 결정한 에이전트 소켓에서 요청을 수신합니다."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kjør GnuPG-kommandoer fra et skall som peker til Keyguards agent-hjemmemappe. Keyguard lytter på agent-socketen som GnuPG finner for denne hjemmemappen."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Voer GnuPG-opdrachten uit vanuit een shell die naar de agent-home van Keyguard verwijst. Keyguard luistert op de agent-socket die GnuPG voor deze home bepaalt."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uruchamiaj polecenia GnuPG z powłoki wskazującej katalog domowy agenta Keyguard. Keyguard nasłuchuje na gnieździe agenta, które GnuPG przypisuje temu katalogowi domowemu."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Execute comandos GnuPG a partir de um shell que aponta para a página inicial do agente do Keyguard. O Keyguard escuta no S.gpg-agent dentro deste diretório."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Execute comandos GnuPG a partir de um shell que aponte para o diretório raiz do agente Keyguard. O Keyguard estará a escutar no socket do agente que o GnuPG resolve para esse directório raiz."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rulează comenzile GnuPG dintr-un shell care indică spre directorul agentului Keyguard. Keyguard ascultă pe socketul agentului pe care GnuPG îl determină pentru acest director."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выполняйте команды GnuPG из оболочки, указывающей на домашний каталог агента Keyguard. Keyguard слушает сокет агента, который GnuPG определяет для этого каталога."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Покрените GnuPG команде из љуске која показује на почетну фасциклу Keyguard-овог агента. Keyguard слуша на утичници агента коју GnuPG разрешава за ову почетну фасциклу."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kör GnuPG-kommandon från ett skal som pekar mot Keyguards agenthemkatalog. Keyguard lyssnar på den agentsocket som GnuPG matchar för den här hemkatalogen."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Run GnuPG commands from a shell that points to Keyguard's agent home. Keyguard listens on the agent socket that GnuPG resolves for this home."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Виконуйте команди GnuPG з оболонки, яка вказує на домашню теку агента Keyguard. Keyguard слухає сокет агента, який GnuPG визначає для цієї домашньої теки."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chạy các lệnh GnuPG từ một shell trỏ đến thư mục agent của Keyguard. Keyguard lắng nghe trên socket agent mà GnuPG phân giải cho thư mục này."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在指向 Keyguard 代理主目录的终端中运行 GnuPG 命令。Keyguard 会监听 GnuPG 为该主目录解析的代理套接字（Socket）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Run GnuPG commands from a shell that points to Keyguard's agent home. Keyguard listens on the agent socket that GnuPG resolves for this home."
          }
        }
      }
    },
