            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This only turns off future automatic backups. It clears the local folder, password, and attachment choice from Keyguard. The existing backup repository and files in that folder are not deleted."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Isso desativa apenas os backups automáticos futuros. Apaga a pasta local, a senha e a escolha de anexo do Keyguard. O repositório de backup existente e os arquivos nessa pasta não são excluídos."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Isto desativa apenas as cópias de segurança foturas. Remove a pasta local, a palavra-passe e a opção de anexo do Keyguard. O repositório de cópia de segurança existente e os ficheiros nessa pasta não são eliminados."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This only turns off future automatic backups. It clears the local folder, password, and attachment choice from Keyguard. The existing backup repository and files in that folder are not deleted."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Это отключает только будущее автоматическое резервное копирование. Локальная папка, пароль и выбор вложений будут удалены из Keyguard. Существующий репозиторий резервных копий и файлы в этой папке не удаляются."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This only turns off future automatic backups. It clears the local folder, password, and attachment choice from Keyguard. The existing backup repository and files in that folder are not deleted."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This only turns off future automatic backups. It clears the local folder, password, and attachment choice from Keyguard. The existing backup repository and files in that folder are not deleted."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This only turns off future automatic backups. It clears the local folder, password, and attachment choice from Keyguard. The existing backup repository and files in that folder are not deleted."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Це лише вимикає майбутні автоматичні резервні копії. Воно очищає локальну теку, пароль та вибір вкладень із Keyguard. Наявний репозиторій резервних копій і файли в тій теці не видаляються."
          }
