            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The communication is done in two steps: first the agent signals the app to start a session, then both sides connect over a local TCP channel and exchange encrypted messages. The SSH agent acts as a relay, while the Keyguard app performs the actual operations."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
